}

docs {
  # POST /api/v1/auth/login

  Custom session login (not Auth.js). Validates credentials, writes an
  `auth.login` audit row, and sets an **httpOnly `atlas_session` cookie**.
  Run this first so the MBG routes below are authorized.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/auth/login/route.ts`
  **Auth:** none (this is how you get a session). Create a user with `pnpm create-admin`.
  **Roles:** viewer < analyst < admin.

  ## Request body (zod-validated)
  | field | type | notes |
  |---|---|---|
  | email | string (email) | required |
  | password | string | min length 1 |

  ## Responses
  **200** — sets `atlas_session` cookie
  ```json
  { "ok": true }
  ```
  **400** — malformed body · **401** — wrong credentials
  ```json
  { "error": "Email atau kata sandi salah." }
  ```
}
